The local restrictions leave 119 rows. Normalize a row by its nonzero
coefficient in a chosen exceptional induction. Its signed degree and five
signed coefficients are the inputs to the three-constituent calculation.
Source: Janko (1968), Sections 6--7, the omitted calculation on p.16.
-/
